--- !u!114 &1220549919
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1220549912}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3b9fe5a34786f084580e3554ebf51db9, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueTutorial:
    name: Entity
    sentences:
    - Welcome to the arena!
    - Do you like jokes?
    - Well, I do so it doesn't matter.
    - Do you know what a knight does without a sword?
    - Smacks!
    - Isn't it funny?
    - No?
    - . . .
    - Yeah, I forgot to give you a sword
    - So, good luck smacking...
    - What should I tell you?
    - Oh!
    - If you ask me I can start the round and spawn enemyes!
    - And if you defeat enemyes with your book you will gain souls!!!
    - The souls can be spend by the trader.
    - Hope you can find him :)
    - If you don't know how to move or smack, try an easier game.
    - Dash in the direction you are moving when dash isn't on cooldown...
    - and becouse you suck, here is a little gift to make you last a bit longer.
    - Your first spell a heal!
    - You can switch to healing with a 1 and back to sword with a Q.
    - That's all the boring stuff!
    - Lets have some fun now!
    - Don't die :)
  dialogueTutorial5:
    name: Entity
    sentences:
    - Wow, you made it to the fifth round!
    - But don't worry, it will get only harder :)
    - There might be just a few things you'r missing.
    - Don't worry though, you'll need a lot more skill to survive now.
    - But I like you, so here is a new spell!
    - A fire ball spell!!!
    - Don't die :)
  dialogueTutorial10:
    name: Entity
    sentences:
    - You'r half way through!
    - Keep it up ;)
    - I'am impressed.
    - I had never expected a challenger getting so far!
    - There should have been a boss, but it would take too much time to make...
    - So you'll need to be satisfied with a harder wave.
    - To make you happier, here is a new spell you can play with!
    - A laser spell!!!
    - Good luck :)
  dialogueTutorial15:
    name: Entity
    sentences:
    - I don't have more spells to give you, but I still wanted to talk to you.
    - You made it nearly to the end.
    - I never expected someone could.
    - So even I don't know what will happen.
    - '. . . '
    - It won't be easy.
  dialogueTutorial20:
    name: Entity
    sentences:
    - It's the last round.
    - Nobody made it this far.
    - I hope you choose wisely
    - Don't be stupid.
  dialogue:
    name: Entity
    sentences:
    - Do you want to start the next round?
  dialogue1:
    name: Entity
    sentences: []
  dialogue2:
    name: Entity
    sentences:
    - You coward!
  nextButton: {fileID: 1079192389}
  optionsButton: {fileID: 1055471795}
  sword: {fileID: 635583674}
