  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueTutorial:
    name: Cubert
    sentences:
    - Hi!
    - I'am a talking wall!
    - Like, what did you expect?
    - My name is litteraly Cubert...
    - Yeah, I was born when this world was created and uh it was pretty boring beforu
      you came.
    - Only your brothet comes around every so often.
    - You know he actually has a sword, nlike you...
    - Yes and I'am supposed to tell you that the developer of this game has a girlfriend.
    - Her name is NIky.
  Trigger: {fileID: 1286244317}
  col: {fileID: 1800211747}
